办。\"},\"certainty\":\"uncertain\",\"visibility\":\"private\"},\"dialogue.84ce040523c7049bfe86990805584b69d70ecfa893b79b7aefadb76c1c049461.d6bdce8c3df89fc42064161b1a2cd5485ce245dc8855323a9dff8c60a2d1d95b.message\":{\"effectiveAt\":{\"id\":\"legacy.story.order\",\"clock\":\"turn\",\"at\":12,\"actorId\":\"legacy.story\"},\"discoveryConditions\":[\"actual-receipt\"],\"dependencyRefs\":[],\"id\":\"dialogue.84ce040523c7049bfe86990805584b69d70ecfa893b79b7aefadb76c1c049461.d6bdce8c3df89fc42064161b1a2cd5485ce245dc8855323a9dff8c60a2d1d95b.message\",\"entityId\":\"bright\",\"field\":\"reported_message\",\"value\":{\"kind\":\"reported_message\",\"speakerId\":\"bright\",\"text\":\"不过村医写的是举荐你求医求学的信，这算熟人之间的托付。前堂的人多半不敢擅自拿主意，即便接了信，最后也得转交到馆主手里，由他亲自过目。\"},\"certainty\":\"uncertain\",\"visibility\":\"private\"},\"dialogue.84ce040523c7049bfe86990805584b69d70ecfa893b79b7aefadb76c1c049461.313b5e1b5e85f266f052a9981dae175809257449a1159b5a5c9e964e2124487d.message\":{\"effectiveAt\":{\"id\":\"legacy.story.order\",\"clock\":\"turn\",\"at\":12,\"actorId\":\"legacy.story\"},\"discoveryConditions\":[\"actual-receipt\"],\"dependencyRefs\":[],\"id\":\"dialogue.84ce040523c7049bfe86990805584b69d70ecfa893b79b7aefadb76c1c049461.313b5e1b5e85f266f052a9981dae175809257449a1159b5a5c9e964e2124487d.message\",\"entityId\":\"bright\",\"field\":\"reported_message\",\"value\":{\"kind\":\"reported_message\",\"speakerId\":\"bright\",\"text\":\"先递给门前接待的人引荐即可。馆主若是愿意见，自然会出来同你说话；若是有急诊在忙，也得看他们里头的安排。\"},\"certainty\":\"uncertain\",\"visibility\":\"private\"}},\"memory\":null,\"contextRef\":\"c280d0a16d0ff7be00eb4299201b607ca4ac80bcf07e35926f8c380fbb25d602\"},\"recoveryAttempted\":false,\"attempts\":[{\"status\":\"failed\",\"rawReply\":\"{\\\"schemaVersion\\\":\\\"dialogue-reception/7\\\",\\\"contextRef\\\":\\\"c280d0a16d0ff7be00eb4299201b607ca4ac80bcf07e35926f8c380fbb25d602\\\",\\\"selections\\\":[{\\\"fragmentId\\\":\\\"f4\\\",\\\"quote\\\":\\\"黄泉\\\"},{\\\"fragmentId\\\":\\\"f5\\\",\\\"quote\\\":\\\"答道：\\\"},{\\\"fragm